  "sourceTitle": "Whiskey Dogs",
  "sourceText": "Whiskey Dogs\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup brown sugar\n1 (14 oz.) bottle ketchup\n1 cup whiskey\nSmokies or little hot dogs (cocktail wieners)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix first three ingredients. Add wieners. Simmer in crock pot for 1-1 1/2 hours.\n\nAbout\n\n\nServe with toothpicks.",
